<title>JAPAN: Canon shares jump, helped by weaker yen.</title>
<headline>Canon shares jump, helped by weaker yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Canon Inc jumped in Wednesday morning trade, extending their rally into a third day, helped by the yen's weakening trend against the dollar, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price of the major Japanese printer and copier manufacturer stood 40 yen higher at 2,240 yen at 0104 GMT. Volume was 1.12 million shares.</p>
